{"step_index":162,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T15:00:15Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-11T17:00:15+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: dcc102cf-facd-4d9b-8d91-c684bfca7058/task-162\nTask Description: /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/.venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport networkx as nx\nfrom graphcalc.graphs.invariants.domination import roman_domination_number\nimport random\n\nbest_val = -999\nbest_g = None\n\n# Optimization to maximize rad - rom\nfor rep in range(1000):\n    n = random.randint(4, 25)\n    # Start with a path or tree\n    G = nx.path_graph(n)\n    # randomly add/remove edges while keeping connected\n    for step in range(50):\n        rad = nx.radius(G)\n        rom = roman_domination_number(G)\n        diff = rad - rom\n        if diff > best_val:\n            best_val = diff\n            best_g = (n, list(G.edges()))\n            print(f'New best diff = {diff} (rad={rad}, rom={rom}, n={n})')\n            if diff >= 0:\n                print('COUNTEREXAMPLE FOUND!')\n                exit(0)\n        # mutate\n        if random.random() < 0.5:\n            # add random edge\n            u, v = random.sample(list(G.nodes()), 2)\n            if not G.has_edge(u, v):\n                G.add_edge(u, v)\n        else:\n            # remove edge if still connected\n            if G.number_of_edges() > n - 1:\n                e = random.choice(list(G.edges()))\n                G.remove_edge(*e)\n                if not nx.is_connected(G):\n                    G.add_edge(*e)\n\nprint(f'Search finished. Best diff found: {best_val}')\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/dcc102cf-facd-4d9b-8d91-c684bfca7058/.system_generated/tasks/task-162.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
